<title>USA: NORTEK OFFERS $275 MLN IN SENIOR NOTES.</title>
<headline>NORTEK OFFERS $275 MLN IN SENIOR NOTES.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nortek Inc said Monday it would offer $275 million in Rule 144A senior notes to pay for its planned acquisition of Ply Gem Industries Inc.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of building products said it will use the proceeds of the offering -- which it expects to close in August -- in addition to $142.7 million in cash and $121 million of assumed debt to buy Ply Gem's outstanding shares at $19.50 a share.</p>
<p>Nortek topped Atrium Corp's $18.75 a share bid for Ply Gem on July 24 by offering to pay $19.50 a share for the maker of home improvement products.</p>
</text>
